              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bikulu bioosi nibio balimanga solichayo tawe, sikila oliria embululwe ne kamawa. Ne kakhali aliba abuundu e khukhwaya chikhaafu ne kamakheese.",
